Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.52,0:00:55.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《邪恶力量》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.70,0:00:59.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（托莱多 俄亥俄州）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.92,0:00:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}邪恶力量前情提要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Previously on Supernatural.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.38,0:00:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那晚发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.57,0:00:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赶快带你弟弟出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your brother outside as fast as you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.53,0:00:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快 迪恩 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Dean! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.15,0:00:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们亲眼目睹\N{\fnArial\fs30}What they witnessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.45,0:00:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.80,0:00:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sent two brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.87,0:00:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸已经踏上了捕猎之旅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad is on a hunting trip…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.34,0:00:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他好几天没回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he hasn't been home in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.96,0:00:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从此踏上征途 22年后\N{\fnArial\fs30}On a quest for answers. 22 years later.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.88,0:00:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发过誓我再也不猎魔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swore I was done hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.67,0:00:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一个人不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do this alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.38,0:00:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.76,0:00:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们有活儿干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.68,0:00:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是爸爸最最有价值的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is dad's single, most valuable possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.97,0:00:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他所有知道的关于恶魔的东西都记载在这里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything he knows about every evil thing, it is in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.56,0:00:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得他想让我们继续他的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he wants us to pick up where he left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.69,0:00:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道 拯救人类 猎杀恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, saving people, hunting things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.85,0:00:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}家族事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Family business.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.90,0:00:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我得找出杀杰西卡的凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I gotta find Jessica's killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.77,0:00:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我现在唯一想做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the only thing I can think about.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.36,0:00:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 你知道我们会找到爸爸的 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, you know that we're gonna find dad, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.00,0:00:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.72,0:01:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 轮到你了真心话还是大冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, your turn. Truth or dare?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.00,0:01:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真心话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.22,0:01:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想和本杰·斯沃茨约会吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you wanna make outwith Benjy Swartz?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.23,0:01:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 大冒险 - 那好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dare. - Okay, lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.44,0:01:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}胆小鬼你必须…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.73,0:01:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3} 在浴室里说 镜子巫婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}say "Bloody Mary" in the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.32,0:01:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是你能想到的最好的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that the bestyou can come up with?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.49,0:01:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁是 镜子巫婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's Bloody Mary?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.03,0:01:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是个巫婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's this witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.95,0:01:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听说她死于车祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard she was a ladykilled in a car crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.33,0:01:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是谁不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter who she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.95,0:01:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要你在浴室里说三次 她的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Point is, if you say her name three timesin the bathroom mirror…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.37,0:01:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她就会出现… 。-\N{\fnArial\fs30}she appears…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.33,0:01:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把你的眼睛挖出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and scratches your eyes out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.42,0:01:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么没人提到这些呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why would anyone say it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.97,0:01:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为那是假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it isn't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.84,0:01:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别开灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}No turning on the lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.68,0:01:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}记住 要说三次哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}three times.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.50,0:02:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}镜子巫婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bloody Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.38,0:02:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这太愚蠢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is so stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.51,0:02:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}镜子巫婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bloody Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.14,0:02:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}镜子巫婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bloody Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.90,0:02:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 吓着你了吧 - 你们太可恶了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Scared you. - You guys are jerks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.41,0:02:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.62,0:02:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起 鞋匠先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}GIRLSSorry, Mr. Shoemaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.33,0:03:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你这么喜欢他啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You so like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.83,0:03:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 女孩们 玩的挺开心哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, geek.You guys having fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.62,0:03:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们回来的太晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're out past curfew.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.54,0:03:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知道了 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.50,0:04:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.55,0:04:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.34,0:04:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, Sam? Why, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.84,0:04:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.35,0:04:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想我是在做噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it I was having a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.02,0:04:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 一个接一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.03,0:04:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 至少我小睡了会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, at least I got some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.90,0:04:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们迟早得谈谈这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sooner or later, we're gonna have to talk about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.91,0:04:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们到了吗 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're here? - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.58,0:04:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恩 欢迎来到托莱多。-俄亥俄州\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Toledo, Ohio.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.04,0:04:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你认为在这个家伙身上 到底发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you thinkhappened to this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.38,0:04:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这正是我们要去查清楚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what we're gonna find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.46,0:05:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.49,0:05:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 嘿 - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.70,0:05:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我能为你做些什么吗 - 恩 我们是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can I help you? - Yeah, we're the…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.33,0:05:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}医学院的学生\N{\fnArial\fs30}med students.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.79,0:05:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 对不起 - 噢 菲葛拉维奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry? - Oh, Doctor…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.21,0:05:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}医生没告诉你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feiklowicz didn't tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.09,0:05:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们和他在电话里谈过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We talked to him on the phone. He.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.92,0:05:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们来自俄亥俄州\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're from Ohio State.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.26,0:05:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他让我们查看一下鞋匠的尸体 为了我们的论文\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's supposed to show usthe Shoemaker corpse. For our paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.59,0:05:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 喔 对不起 他现在在吃午饭 - 哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, l'm sorry. He's at lunch. - Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.22,0:05:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是这样 他说… 。-这也没什么关系的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he said-Well, you know, it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.60,0:05:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你可以让我们看看尸体吗 - 对不起我不能那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't mind showing us the body? - Sorry, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.69,0:06:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他会在一个小时内回来 如果你们愿意 可以在这等他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc will be back in an hour.You can wait for him, if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.02,0:06:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个小时 哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}An hour? Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.03,0:06:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我们得马上回哥伦布\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta be heading backto Columbus by then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.11,0:06:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 伙计这个论文要占我们成绩的一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, this paper's half our grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.91,0:06:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你不会介意帮帮我们吧 - 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So if you don't mind helping us out. - Look, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.99,0:06:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.04,0:06:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想揍扁这家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna hit him in his face, I swear-
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.80,0:06:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟我来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.81,0:06:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}兄弟 这可是我赢的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, I earned that money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.35,0:06:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你打牌赢来的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won it in a poker game.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.14,0:06:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.65,0:06:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}报纸上说是他女儿找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, the newspaper saidhis daughter found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.02,0:06:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她说他的眼睛在流血\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said his eyes were bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.73,0:06:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不止那样 他的眼睛被溶化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than that.They practically liquefied.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.07,0:06:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有任何搏斗的迹象吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any sign of a struggle?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.03,0:06:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 或许是某人做的 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe somebody did it to him? - Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.49,0:06:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除了他的女儿就没别的人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides the daughter, he was all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.87,0:07:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}官方对于死亡的解释是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the official cause of death?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.29,0:07:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}医生也不太确定 他觉得可能因为动脉瘤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc's not sure.He's thinking massive stroke…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.88,0:07:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而导致大出血\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe an aneurysm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.96,0:07:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但可以肯定的是是脑内部被破坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something burst up in there, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.26,0:07:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你的意思 - 剧烈脑部出血\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you mean? - lntense cerebral bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.76,0:07:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从没看到别人的头颅上有他这么多的血迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy had more blood in his skullthan anyone l've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.22,0:07:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但那双眼睛 是怎么回事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the eyes.What would cause something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.06,0:07:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毛细血管会突然破裂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Capillaries can burst.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.68,0:07:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很多人死的时候眼睛也流血\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of bloodshot eyeswith stroke victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.02,0:07:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恩 你是否曾经看过和这一样的眼睛吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you ever see exploding eyeballs?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.56,0:07:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也是头一回看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a first for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.19,0:07:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是 我可不是医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, hey, l'm not the doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.19,0:07:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们能看看警方的验尸报告吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, think we could lookat the police report?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.53,0:07:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也明白的 这是为了我们的论文\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, for our paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.99,0:07:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我真的不能把报告给你们看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not really supposed toshow you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.91,0:07:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能不是恶鬼做的 只是比较奇怪的医学事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might not be one of ours.Might just be some freak medical thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.50,0:07:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那在老爸的常年的抓鬼工作中有哪次真是怪异的医学事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times in Dad's long careerhas it been a freak medical thing…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.25,0:07:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而不是灵异鬼怪事件吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not some sign ofawful supernatural death?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.63,0:07:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好象从来没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost never.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.55,0:07:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 没错 - 那好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Exactly. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.85,0:07:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我们和他女儿谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go talk to the daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.85,0:07:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们好象穿得不太合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like we're underdressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.58,0:08:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你一定就是唐娜 是吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You must be Donna, right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.38,0:08:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 嗨 我们真的对此很抱歉 - 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi. We're really sorry. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.76,0:08:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是萨姆 这是迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Sam. This is Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.64,0:08:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们是你爸的同事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We worked with your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.26,0:08:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 真的吗 - 是的 这整件事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You did? - Yeah. This whole thing…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.52,0:08:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得这是突然中风\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, a stroke.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.10,0:08:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我觉得她可能不想说起这些 - 没关系我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't think she really wants to talk. - It's okay. l'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.98,0:08:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事发之前有什么症状吗 有头昏眼花 偏头痛吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were there ever any symptoms?Dizziness? Migraines?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.86,0:08:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.99,0:09:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是因为这根本就不是中风 - 莉莉 别乱说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's because it wasn't a stroke. - Lily, don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.62,0:09:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 什么 - 不好意思她有点心烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - l'm sorry. She's just upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.70,0:09:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 这全是因为我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it happened because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.67,0:09:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 亲爱的 不是那样 - 莉莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sweetie, it didn't. - Lily…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.71,0:09:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么你会这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}why would you saysomething like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.30,0:09:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在他死前 我曾经说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right before he died, I said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.55,0:09:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你说了什么 - 「血腥码丽」\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You said what? - "Bloody Mary."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.05,0:09:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对着浴室的镜子说了三遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three times in the bathroom mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.97,0:09:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她拿走了他的眼睛 她的确是这样做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She took his eyes.That's what she does.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.02,0:09:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但那不是爸爸致死的原因 这不是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not why Dad died.This isn't your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.94,0:09:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得你姐姐说的对 莉莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think your sister's right, Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.19,0:09:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}根本就没血腥码丽这种东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no wayit could've been Bloody Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.73,0:09:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你父亲没那么说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, your dad didn't say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.57,0:09:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.74,0:09:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恩 我想也许我错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.35,0:10:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于血腥码丽的传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Bloody Mary Legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.52,0:10:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸以前有找到过能证明这事的证据吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad ever find any evidencethat it was a real thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.98,0:10:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据我所知没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that I know of.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.36,0:10:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也知道 在其他地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, everywhere else…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.78,0:10:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个国家的很多孩子都在玩血腥码丽这个游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}all over the country, kids play Bloody Mary…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.99,0:10:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据我们所知 没人因此而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}and as far as we know, nobody dies from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.37,0:10:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也可能在其它地方那只是个故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe everywhere it's a story, but here it's actually happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.58,0:10:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但在这却真实地发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The place where the legend began?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.63,0:10:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能这是传说开始的地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}But according to the legend, the person who says.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.96,0:10:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但根据传说那个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The person who saysyou-know-what gets it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.68,0:10:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 但在这里是的 - 鞋匠没那么做却…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But here… - Shoemaker gets it instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.89,0:10:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.60,0:10:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从没听说这样的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never heard anything like that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.10,0:10:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且这个人是死在镜子前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still, the guy did dieright in front of the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.89,0:10:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她小女儿话是对的 按传说来说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the daughter's right.The way the legend goes…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.52,0:10:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道谁来挖走了你的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}you-know-who scratchesyour eyes out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.69,0:10:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这值得一查\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's worth checking in to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.11,0:11:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们在楼上做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.58,0:11:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们… 我们想上厕所\N{\fnArial\fs30}We-We had to go to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.41,0:11:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.33,0:11:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像我在楼下所说的我们和唐娜是父亲的同事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like we said downstairs, we work with Donna's dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.17,0:11:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可他只是一个销售员 他自己一个人工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a day trader or something.He worked by himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.96,0:11:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我都知道只是… …\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I know. I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.71,0:11:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有在楼下问的那些古怪的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all thoseweird questions downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.63,0:11:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.97,0:11:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们向我做出解释不然我就要叫人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you tell me what's going on, or I start screaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.60,0:11:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.06,0:11:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们认为唐娜的爸爸死于某种原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}We think something happenedto Donna's dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.15,0:11:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对啊 中风\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, a stroke.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.77,0:11:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那不是中风的典型症状\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not the sign of a typical stroke.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.82,0:11:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们认为还有其它原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}We think it might be something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.20,0:11:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 比如 - 老实说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like what? - Honestly…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.66,0:11:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们现在也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}we don't know yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.08,0:11:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我们不希望这发生在其他人身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we don't want itto happen to anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.45,0:11:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事实就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.16,0:11:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以如果你真的想叫的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you're gonna scream…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.33,0:11:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那随你便\N{\fnArial\fs30}go right ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.13,0:11:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们是谁 是警察吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you, cops?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.67,0:12:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 差不多吧 - 我要告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Something like that. - Tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.88,0:12:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是你一想起什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. You think of anything…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.47,0:12:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你或者你的朋友发现奇怪的事 超乎寻常的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}you or your friends noticeanything strange, out of the ordinary…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.97,0:12:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请给我们打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}just give us a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.28,0:12:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果这个镇上真有召唤镜子巫婆的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say Bloody Mary really ishaunting this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.57,0:12:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就一定有某些证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gonna be some proof, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.53,0:12:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}例如当地一个死的很恐怖的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A local woman who died nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.11,0:12:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但根据传说来这实在太麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But a legend this widespread, it's hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.20,0:12:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于她的身份大概有50种说法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's like 50 versionsof who she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.29,0:12:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有些说她是个女巫另一写说\N{\fnArial\fs30}One says she's a witch, another says…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.29,0:12:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是个遇害的新娘 还有其他一大堆说法\N{\fnArial\fs30}she's a mutilated bride.There's a lot more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.04,0:12:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我们应该去寻找什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are we looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.67,0:12:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于她的每个版本有个共同点 她是个叫玛丽的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every version's got things in common.It's always a woman named Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.17,0:12:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她死在镜子前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she always diesright in front of a mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.55,0:12:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我们该去找找当地的报纸 在那些公众信息里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta search newspapers, public records, as far back as they go…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.18,0:12:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看我们是否能找到个符合条件的玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}see if we can find a Marywho fits the bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.55,0:12:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 这么找太烦人了 - 不 这没什么的… …\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, that sounds annoying. - No, it won't be so bad…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.51,0:12:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}as long as we…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.60,0:12:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我收回我的话 真是很烦啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh, I take it back.This will be very annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.52,0:13:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也不清楚 他们是警察侦探或者是其他什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure. They were copsor detectives or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.11,0:13:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}管他们是什么不过他们长的挺帅的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever they were, they were cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.95,0:13:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吉尔 你不那么想吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jill. You didn't think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.16,0:13:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 他们是帅哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay, they were cute, but still…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.74,0:13:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是 你不觉得在唐娜的父亲身上可能真的有些奇怪的事发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you think something could havehappened to Donna's dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.83,0:13:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许 莉莉是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Lily was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.66,0:13:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许是镜子巫婆做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Bloody Mary got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.96,0:13:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈哈 听上去好有趣哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha, ha. Very funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.54,0:13:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等 对不起 我听出来你很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, l'm sorry.Was that fear I hear in your voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.97,0:13:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有查理…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.18,0:13:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我现在要走到浴室的镜子前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm walkingto the bathroom mirror right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.85,0:13:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吉尔 别那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jill, quit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.85,0:13:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 不 我控制不了我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. I can't help myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.27,0:13:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要说出口了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.86,0:13:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}镜子巫婆 镜子巫婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bloody Mary, Bloody Mary…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.36,0:13:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}镜子巫婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bloody Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.16,0:13:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吉尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jill?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.91,0:13:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吉尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jill!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.50,0:14:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你这个胆小鬼我明天打给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're such a freak.I'll call you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.89,0:15:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是你干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.02,0:15:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你杀了那个男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed that boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.96,0:15:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.47,0:15:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为什么要让我睡着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you let me fall asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.51,0:15:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我是你大哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm an awesome brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.39,0:15:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你梦到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what did you dream about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.52,0:15:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}棒棒糖和糖果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lollipops and candy canes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.02,0:15:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.40,0:15:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你找到什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You find anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.20,0:15:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一无所获 另外一个全新的挫折\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, besides a whole new levelof frustration?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.91,0:15:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么也没 我看了相关的所有资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I've looked at everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.20,0:16:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当地的女人 叫劳拉的或叫凯瑟琳的 在镜前自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few local women, Laura and Cathryn, committed suicide in front of a mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.79,0:16:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有一个巨大的镜子掉在一个叫戴夫男孩身上 可是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a giant mirror fell ona guy named Dave, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.05,0:16:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 玛丽这个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}no Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.05,0:16:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许是我们还没找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we just haven't found it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.93,0:16:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许是我们还没找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've also been searching forstrange deaths in the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.93,0:16:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道吗 我也找寻了这个区域内的奇怪的死亡事件 没有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, eyeball bleeding, that sort of thing. There's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.73,0:16:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里到底发生了什么事也许根本就没有玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever's happening heremaybe just aingt Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.24,0:16:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.37,0:16:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们在浴室的地板上找到了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they found heron the bathroom floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.37,0:16:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她… 。-她的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}And her-Her eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.84,0:16:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它们不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.21,0:16:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.43,0:16:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她说出了那些话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.64,0:17:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听到她说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard her say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.47,0:17:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是不可能就因为那样她就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it couldn't be because of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.44,0:17:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许我想法不太正常 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm insane, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.44,0:17:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 你想法很正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.61,0:17:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天啊 这让我感觉更糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, that makes me feelso much worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.36,0:17:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.49,0:17:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们认为这里有某些事发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We think something's happening here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.29,0:17:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}某些不能解释的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something that can't be explained.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.12,0:17:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我们必须阻止它\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're gonna stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.29,0:17:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我们需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we could use your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.98,0:17:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你和吉尔的妈妈怎么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you tell Jill's mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.48,0:17:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是说我想单独来看看吉尔的照片和物品\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just said I needed some time alonewith Jill's pictures and things.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.40,0:17:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我讨厌向她撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate lying to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.28,0:17:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相信我们这是为了大家好 关灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust us, it's for the greater good.Hit the lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.99,0:18:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们在找什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you guys looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.70,0:18:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们一找到就让你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll let you knowas soon as we find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.91,0:18:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夜视模式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, night vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.96,0:18:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks. Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.84,0:18:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看上去象琶里斯·希尔顿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I look like Paris Hilton?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.93,0:18:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我些不明白 我是指第一个被害人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I don't get it.I mean, the first victim…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.06,0:18:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并没有召唤玛丽 但第二个被害人却那么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}didn't summon Mary, and the second victim did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.15,0:18:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是怎么选上他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is she choosing them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.86,0:18:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.03,0:18:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想知道为什么吉尔会说出那个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna know whyJill said it in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.32,0:18:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那只是个玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.95,0:18:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定有人还会说出那个名字 那只是时间问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, somebody's gonna say it again.It's just a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.26,0:19:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.39,0:19:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}箱子里有夜光的东西 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a black lightin the trunk, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.58,0:19:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}加里·不莱曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gary Bryman?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.91,0:19:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道他是谁吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know who that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.50,0:19:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.88,0:19:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}加里·不莱曼是个8岁的男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Gary Brymanwas an 8-year-old boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.89,0:19:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两年前 他在跑闹中被撞死司机肇事后逃逸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two years ago, he was killed in a hit-and-run.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.22,0:19:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是辆黑色的丰田车\N{\fnArial\fs30}The car was described asa black Toyota Camry…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.73,0:19:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可没人有照片也没人看到驾驶员\N{\fnArial\fs30}but nobody got the platesor saw the driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.52,0:19:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.44,0:19:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 什么 - 吉尔 就开那种车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Jill drove that car.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.61,0:20:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们需要再去一次你朋友唐娜的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to getto your friend Donna's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.66,0:20:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鞋匠琳达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Linda Shoemaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.96,0:20:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们为什么要来问我这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you asking me this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.85,0:20:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 不好意思可这真的很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we're sorry, but it's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.59,0:20:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 琳达是我妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Linda's my mom, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.34,0:20:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她服用了过量的安眠药\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she overdosed on sleeping pills.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.34,0:20:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是一场意外 就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was an accident, and that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.31,0:20:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我想你们该走了 - 唐娜 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think you should leave. - Donna, just-
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.35,0:20:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给我滚出我的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get out of my house!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.48,0:20:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.44,0:20:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们认为她父亲杀害了她的母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really think her dadcould've killed her mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.61,0:20:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.20,0:20:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想我得留下来陪她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I should stick around.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.28,0:20:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 无论你想怎样 但不能… 。-\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Whatever you do, don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.20,0:20:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相信我 我不会说出去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, I won't say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.63,0:21:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等 你进行全国性的搜索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait.You're doing a nationwide search?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.25,0:21:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的美国联邦调查局里所有数据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. The NClC, the FBI database.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.01,0:21:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找到在国内任何死在镜子前的玛丽对我来说都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}At this point, any Mary who died in frontof a mirror is good enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.84,0:21:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但如果她在这个镇里作乱的话 她就应该是死于这个镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if she's haunting the town, she should've died in the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.10,0:21:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我告诉过你当地的资料里什么都没有 除非你有更好的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing local.Unless you got a better idea…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.98,0:21:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 好象有着某条线索 - 我也不清楚我也在想这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- lt seems like there's a pattern. - I was thinking the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.35,0:21:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鞋匠和吉尔的肇事逃逸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Shoemaker and Jill's hit-and-run.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.55,0:21:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都有关于某人死亡的秘密对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both had secrets where people died.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.32,0:21:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于镜子民间有很多传说 它们揭露你的谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's folklore about mirrors.They reveal your lies…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.36,0:21:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的秘密 你真实灵魂的反映\N{\fnArial\fs30}your secrets.They're a true reflection of your soul…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.16,0:21:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打破它你会很倒霉\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is why it's bad luckto break them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.12,0:21:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不错 不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.33,0:21:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以假如是你有着这样的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}So maybe if you've got a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.10,0:21:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比如别人的死与你有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}like a real nasty one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.50,0:21:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后 玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}then Mary sees it…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.71,0:21:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就会看到这个秘密并且惩罚你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and punishes you for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.27,0:21:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管你是否召唤她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whether you summoned her or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.33,0:21:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.39,0:21:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看着很象同样的手印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like the same handprint.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.47,0:21:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她叫玛丽·华辛顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her name was Mary Worthington.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.89,0:22:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在韦恩堡。-印第安纳州死于谋杀至今未能结案\N{\fnArial\fs30}An unsolved murder inFort Wayne, Indiana.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.32,0:22:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我做这个工作35年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was on the job for 35 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.74,0:22:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大部分做侦探工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detective for most of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.40,0:22:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 可能所有人都不太记起那个案件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, everybody packs it inwith a few loose ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.07,0:22:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这起 玛丽·华辛顿的谋杀案\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the Mary Worthington murder…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.70,0:22:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还是记忆犹新\N{\fnArial\fs30}that one still gets me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.33,0:22:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到底发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.91,0:22:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们自称是记者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You boys said you were reporters.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.04,0:22:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据我们所知 玛丽19岁独自一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know Mary was 19, lived by herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.34,0:22:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她赢了一些选美比赛 梦想走出印地安那\N{\fnArial\fs30}She won a few beauty contests.Dreamt of getting out of lndiana…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.84,0:22:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}成为一个演员 在5月29日 晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}being an actress.And we know the night of March 29th…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.51,0:22:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人闯进了她的房间 杀害了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}someone broke into her apartmentand murdered her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.18,0:22:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}用刀挖出了她的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut out her eyes with a knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.18,0:22:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.10,0:22:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看 先生 我们问你发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we ask you what happened, we wanna know what…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.77,0:22:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们是想问你关于这案件的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}you think happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.11,0:22:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一般来说 我不应该有这样的复印件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Technically, l'm notsupposed to have a copy of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.24,0:22:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.37,0:22:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}see that there?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.96,0:23:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- T-R-E - 恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "T-R-E"? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.79,0:23:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想玛丽想拼出杀害她凶手的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think Mary was trying tospell the name of her killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.46,0:23:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你知道他是谁吗 - 不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know who it was? - Not for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.38,0:23:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这有个当地的外科医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there was a local man, a surgeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.26,0:23:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}特雷弗·桑浦森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trevor Samson.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.18,0:23:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得是他干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think he cut her up good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.56,0:23:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么他会那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, why would he dosomething like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.93,0:23:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的日记里提到了她遇到的一个男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her diary mentioneda man that she was seeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.94,0:23:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她用他名字的第一个字母 T称呼他\N{\fnArial\fs30}She called him by his initial, T.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.61,0:23:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的最后一篇日记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, her last entry…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.98,0:23:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她将要告诉T的老婆他们间的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}she was gonna tell T's wifeall about their affair.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.99,0:23:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可你怎么断定是桑浦森杀害了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how do you know it wasthis guy Samson who killed her?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.95,0:23:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这很难说\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hard to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.74,0:23:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但她眼睛被挖出来的方式 手法很专业\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the way her eyes were cut out, it was almost professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.96,0:23:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可你没法证明是他杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you could never prove it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.83,0:23:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 没有指纹 没有目击证人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No prints, no witnesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.42,0:23:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他很小心翼翼\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was meticulous.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.34,0:23:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他还活着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.30,0:23:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.72,0:24:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就向你们问我的 玛丽用她生命的最后时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you ask me, Mary spent her last living moments…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.68,0:24:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去揭示这个家伙的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to expose this guy's secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.11,0:24:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但她没法做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she never could.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.44,0:24:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她埋葬在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's she buried?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.03,0:24:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 她被火化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wasn't. She was cremated.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.37,0:24:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这面镜子呢 它没被做为证据锁在某处 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about that mirror?It's not in some evidence lockup, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.87,0:24:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.87,0:24:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很久前就被退还给玛丽的家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was returned to Mary's familya long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.04,0:24:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有他们家族的名字吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have the names of her family, by any chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.38,0:24:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你把这些陌生人带到我家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bring these strangers into my houseand they ask me things like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.26,0:24:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们还向我提出那样的问题 他们只是想帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were only trying to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.56,0:24:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}求你了 唐娜 你得相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.Donna, you have to believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.85,0:24:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相信什么 关于镜子巫婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? About Bloody Mary?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.77,0:24:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}求你了 我知道这听上去很疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. I know it sounds crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.19,0:24:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的只是疯狂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crazy doesn't even begin to cover it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.52,0:24:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对我妹妹来说 可以相信这些假话 她只有12岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's one thing for my sisterto believe this crap. She's 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.78,0:24:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.36,0:24:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想想你爸爸是怎么死的 想想吉尔是怎么死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the way your dad died, okay?And the way Jill died.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.33,0:25:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 那么 镜子巫婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so Bloody Mary…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.91,0:25:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 不 - 镜子巫婆 镜子巫婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - …Bloody Mary, Bloody Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.08,0:25:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看 没事发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? Nothing happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.55,0:25:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为什么那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.17,0:25:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.80,0:25:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真的有病\N{\fnArial\fs30}There really is somethingwrong with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.82,0:25:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}原子在失去电子后就会变成阳离子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elements that lose electronsbecome positive ions…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.78,0:25:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比起同元素的其它粒子要小\N{\fnArial\fs30}which are smaller than other atomsof the same element.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.45,0:25:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是说 它的半径小于其它的粒子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Therefore, the ionic radius is smallerthan the atomic radius.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.04,0:25:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.47,0:25:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.35,0:26:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}查理 停下来 怎么拉冷静一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie, stop it! What's wrong?Just calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.14,0:26:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我走查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go!Charlie!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.52,0:26:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 真的吗 那可太糟糕了 华辛顿先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, really?That's too bad, Mr. Worthington.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.44,0:26:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来我得出高价才能买下那镜子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would've paid a lot for that mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.49,0:26:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 等下次有机会 好的 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Well, maybe next time.All right, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.32,0:26:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 怎么了 - 那是玛丽的兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So? - So that was Mary's brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.95,0:26:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}家族保留了那面镜子许多年直到他几个星期前把它卖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mirror was in the family for yearsuntil he sold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.08,0:26:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一星期前\N{\fnArial\fs30}One week ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.50,0:26:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一家叫ESTATE的古董店 在拖莱多\N{\fnArial\fs30}To a store called Estate Antiques.A store in Toledo.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.96,0:26:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以说镜子到哪里玛丽也去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So wherever the mirror goes, Mary goes?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.34,0:26:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的魂魄肯定和镜子有某种联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her spirit's definitelytied up with it somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.97,0:26:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是有迷信说镜子可以抓住魂魄吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't there an old superstition that saysmirrors can capture spirits?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.47,0:26:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当有人在房间里死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}When someonewould die in a house…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.39,0:26:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人们会用镜子遮盖住不让魂魄被困留住\N{\fnArial\fs30}people would cover the mirrorsso the ghost wouldn't get trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.69,0:26:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽 死的时候那面镜子吸收了她的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary dies in front of a mirror, it draws in her spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.35,0:26:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 可她怎么在100多个不同的镜子里来去自如\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but how can she move through, like, a hundred different mirrors?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.90,0:26:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也不知道 如果那镜子是源头的话我建议我们找到并毁灭它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, but if the mirror's asource, I say we find it and smash it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.11,0:27:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恩 我也不知道也许这样能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I don't know. Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.99,0:27:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.08,0:27:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.02,0:27:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.39,0:27:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.52,0:27:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可以睁开你的眼睛了 查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can open up your eyes, Charlie.It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.52,0:27:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.23,0:27:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.65,0:27:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就呆在床上别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna stay right here, on this bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.78,0:27:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你别注视玻璃或者任何有反射的东西 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're not gonna look at glass oranything else that has a reflection, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.45,0:27:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要你不那么做 她就无法靠近你。-\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, as long as you do that, she cannot get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.91,0:27:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我不能永远那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't keep that up forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.79,0:27:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会死 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna die, aren't l?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.92,0:28:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.55,0:28:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不会永远不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not any time soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.06,0:28:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.68,0:28:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们需要知道发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.68,0:28:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们在卫生间里 唐娜说了她的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were in the bathroom.Donna said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.27,0:28:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不是我想要问的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what we're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.27,0:28:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有发生过些事情 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something happened, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.11,0:28:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在你过去的生活里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.07,0:28:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能是个秘密…\N{\fnArial\fs30}A secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.16,0:28:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}使某人受到伤害的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where someone got hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.37,0:28:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能告诉我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you tell us about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.80,0:28:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有过一个男朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had this boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.88,0:28:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很爱他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I loved him…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.72,0:28:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他有时候也让我害怕 你明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he kind of scared me too, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.97,0:28:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在他家的一天夜里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And one night…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.52,0:28:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们吵了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}at his house, we got in this fight…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.52,0:28:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后我说要分手\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I broke up with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.15,0:29:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他开始心烦意乱 他说他需要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he got upset, and he said he needed me…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.99,0:29:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他也很爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he loved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.49,0:29:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他还说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.20,0:29:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「查理 如果你走出这个门 我就自杀」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Charlie, if you walk out that doorright now, l'm gonna kill myself."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.20,0:29:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道我怎么回答的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And do you know what I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.25,0:29:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说「随你便」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, "Go ahead."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.55,0:29:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I left.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.13,0:29:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我怎么能那么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could I say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.68,0:29:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我怎么能那样离开他\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could I leave him like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.52,0:29:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是… …\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.44,0:29:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我根本就不信他会那么做 你明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't believe him, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.28,0:29:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我应该相信他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should've.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.54,0:30:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道 她男朋友自杀了 但这不是查理的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, her boyfriend killing himself, that's not really Charlie's fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.25,0:30:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}根据我所知道的鬼魂可不能分辨这种情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know as well as I dospirits don't exactly see shades of gray.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.42,0:30:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 查理 有着使某人死亡的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, Charlie had a secret, someone died.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.55,0:30:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这对 玛丽来说就足够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good enough for Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.55,0:30:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也这么猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.39,0:30:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道吗 我在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I've been thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.43,0:30:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们也许不应该把镜子摧毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might not be enoughto just smash that mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.48,0:30:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么 你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.98,0:30:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这很难困住玛丽 不是吗 她从一面的镜子转到另一面镜子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Mary's hard to pin down.She moves from mirror to mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.19,0:30:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁能说她只会一直呆在镜子里面呢 所以我们需要把她困住\N{\fnArial\fs30}So who's to say that she's not gonnajust keep hiding in them forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.45,0:30:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以 也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}So maybe…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.99,0:30:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我们需要把她困住\N{\fnArial\fs30}we should try to pin her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.74,0:30:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道吗把她召唤到原来的镜子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, summon her to her mirror…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.62,0:30:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后把她摧毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then smash it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.41,0:30:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 那好 你怎么知道那肯定有用 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you know that's gonna work? - I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.42,0:30:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.30,0:30:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 谁来召唤她呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, who's gonna summon her?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.42,0:30:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.22,0:30:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她会跟着我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll come after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.51,0:30:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 你知道吗 这就是我要说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you know what? That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.53,0:31:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这和杰西卡有关 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is about Jessica, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.24,0:31:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得这是你痛苦的秘密 某种意义上来说你杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think that's your dirty little secret?That you killed her somehow?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.62,0:31:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 你必须停止这么想 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, this has gotta stop, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.46,0:31:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是说 噩梦连连不停在梦里喊出她的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the nightmares and calling hername out in the middle of the night…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.88,0:31:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这会杀了你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.51,0:31:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.97,0:31:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不是你错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.89,0:31:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你想怪罪谁那就怪罪杀害她的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you wanna blame something, then blame the thing that killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.39,0:31:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或者 你干嘛不痛扁我 是我把你从她身边带走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, why don't you take a swing at me.I dragged you away from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.48,0:31:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不怪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't blame you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.27,0:31:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 你也不该怪你自己 因为对于她你无能为力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't blame yourself.There's nothing you could've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.69,0:31:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 可我能警告她 - 警告什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I could've warned her. - About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.19,0:31:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你根本就不知道会发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't know whatwas gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.32,0:31:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有 这根本就不是一个秘密 我也知道它\N{\fnArial\fs30}And besides, all of this isn't a secret.I mean, I know all about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.83,0:31:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它可能根本就不能吸引玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not gonna work with Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.58,0:32:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 你不了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.00,0:32:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我不了解什么 - 你并不知道事情的全部\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't what? - You don't know all about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.54,0:32:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有些事没告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't told you everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.17,0:32:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.05,0:32:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我全都告诉你了 那就不是秘密了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it wouldn't really be a secretif I told you, would it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.39,0:32:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.60,0:32:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是我不喜欢那样 不要再去想这法子了 忘记它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like it. It's not gonna happen.Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.94,0:32:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 如果我们不做点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, that girl back thereis going to die…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.11,0:32:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个女孩就要死了 你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless we do something about it.And you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.95,0:32:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没人知道此后还有多少同样的人这么死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows how many more peopleare gonna die after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.37,0:32:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在让我们来解决它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we're doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.37,0:32:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你必须让我那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to let me do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.07,0:33:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 这太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.08,0:33:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那好吧 开始找吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's start looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.45,0:34:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许他们早就把它卖掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they've already sold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.71,0:34:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可不那么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.64,0:34:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找到它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.64,0:34:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你确定你要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.66,0:35:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}镜子巫婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bloody Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.07,0:35:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我出去看看 呆在这 小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go check that out, you stay here.Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.41,0:35:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}摧毁任何移动的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smash anything that moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.34,0:35:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.94,0:35:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 停住别动 - 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold it! - Whoa, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.65,0:35:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是假警报 我不小心触动的\N{\fnArial\fs30}False alarm. I tripped the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.24,0:36:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.78,0:36:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是老板的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the boss's kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.91,0:36:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是阿姆西罗先生的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Mr. Yamashiro's kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.84,0:36:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.01,0:36:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}进到这面镜子里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come into this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.99,0:36:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.20,0:36:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.21,0:36:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你杀了杰西卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed Jessica.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.25,0:37:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 就象我说的我是被收养的 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like I said, I was adopted. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.26,0:37:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道吗 我真的 我现在真的没时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I just I really don'thave time for this right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.40,0:37:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你从来都没告诉她真相 你到底是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never told her the truth, who you really were.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.11,0:37:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可不止这些 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's more than that, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.78,0:37:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你做的那些关于\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those nightmares you've been having…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.78,0:37:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杰西卡死亡的噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Jessica dying…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.74,0:37:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尖叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}screaming…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.62,0:37:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}燃烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}burning.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.33,0:37:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在她死前 你是有时间的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had them for daysbefore she died.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.37,0:37:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.04,0:37:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你那么无情的忽略这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were so desperate to be normal…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.00,0:37:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只相信那只是梦境\N{\fnArial\fs30}to believe they were just dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.38,0:37:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么能忽视这些梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you ignore them like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.59,0:37:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么能就让她这么死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you leave her alone to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.72,0:37:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你已经梦到它会发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You dreamt it would happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.69,0:38:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy? Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.86,0:38:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.53,0:38:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 天那 你还好吧 - 恩 还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- God. You okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.82,0:38:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧 来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.93,0:39:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是你杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.60,0:39:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All those people.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.68,0:39:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是你杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.34,0:39:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.09,0:39:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.30,0:39:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来我们要倒600年的霉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This has gotta be like, what, 600 years bad luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.58,0:40:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这一切真的结束了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is really over?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.75,0:40:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.96,0:40:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.98,0:40:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}理查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.65,0:40:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你男朋友的死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your boyfriend's death…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.28,0:40:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你应该原谅你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really should tryto forgive yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.78,0:40:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论你做了什么 你可能不能阻止它\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter what you did, you probably couldn't have stopped it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.03,0:40:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有时不好的事情还是会发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes bad things just happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.30,0:41:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是个好的建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.77,0:41:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.65,0:41:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.40,0:41:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在这都结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that this is all over…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.82,0:41:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想知道你的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}l want you to tell mewhat that secret was.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.70,0:41:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.04,0:41:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是我的大哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my brother…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.41,0:41:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以为你死\N{\fnArial\fs30}and l'd die for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.34,0:41:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但有些秘密我还是要保留\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there are some thingsI need to keep to myself.
